// Footer — 1:1 static port of Footer() from web/app/components/chrome.tsx.
// Base.astro omits it on /admission routes (the old component returned null
// there). Icons inlined verbatim from chrome.tsx Icon (kebab-case SVG attrs).

// Verbatim chrome.tsx Icon paths (JSX camelCase attrs → kebab-case HTML).
